# Uploaded to Vercel: only what the site build needs (src, data/generated, configs, scripts, lockfile).
# Never upload INEC raw downloads, local tool output, or private working notes (top-level Markdown and docs/).
/*.md
/docs/
/pipeline/
/node_modules/
/.next/
/out/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/shots/
/tests/
/.github/
/Makefile
/.env*
/.vercel/
